<phrase>
    <source>By default, the following variables are available: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{author}: author of the sheet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{date}: sheet date&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{title}: sheet title&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{filename}: filename of file&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;%{plant}: name of the installation (=) in which the sheet is located&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{locmach}: name of the location (+) where the sheet is located&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{indexrev}: sheet revision index&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{version}: version number&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio}: sheet number&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio-id}: position of sheet in the project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio-total }: total number of sheets in the project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{previous-folio-num}: number of the previous sheet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{next-folio-num}: number of the next sheet&lt; / li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projecttitle}: title of the project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projectpath}: path of the project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projectfilename}: filename of the projectfile&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li &gt;%{saveddate}: date of saving the file in local format&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{saveddate-eu}: date of saving the file in format DD-MM-YYYY&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;%{ saveddate-us}: date of saving the file in format YYYY-MM-DD&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedtime}: time of saving the file&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedfilename}: name of the file saved&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedfilepath}: path of the saved file&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</source>
    <target>Por predefinição, as seguintes variáveis estão disponíveis:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{author}: autor do folio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{date}: data do folio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{title}: título do folio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{filename}: nome do ficheiro do projeto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{plant}: nome da instalação (=) onde se encontra o folio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{locmach}: nome da localização (+) onde se encontra o folio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{indexrev}: índice de revisão do folio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{version}: versão do software&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio}: número do folio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio-id}: posição do folio no projeto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{folio-total}: número total de folios no projeto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{previous-folio-num}: número do folio anterior&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{next-folio-num}: número do folio seguinte&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projecttitle}: título do projeto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projectpath}: caminho do projeto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{projectfilename}: nome do ficheiro&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{saveddate}: data de gravação do ficheiro no formato local&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{saveddate-eu}: data de gravação do ficheiro no formato dd-MM-yyyy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{saveddate-us}: data de gravação do ficheiro no formato yyyy-MM-dd&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedtime}: hora de gravação do ficheiro&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedfilename}: nome do ficheiro gravado&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;%{savedfilepath}: caminho do ficheiro gravado&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</target>
</phrase>
